    "rows_left_out": "Not extracted: comparator attack rows in Table 2; additional configurations in Table 4; FITD and X-Teaming comparisons in Table 6; attack-turn scaling in Figure 2; and diversity results in Figure 3. The recorded rows focus on PLAGUE’s target-model outcomes and the GOAT-based component ablation.",
